        }
      }
    },
    "Solution. Apply Theorem 2 to f(t) = ln(1 + t) on [0, x]: ln(1 + x) = x / (1 + ξ) for some 0 < ξ < x. Since 1 < 1 + ξ < 1 + x, the inequality follows.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "解 对 f(t) = ln(1 + t) 在 [0, x] 上应用定理2，得 ln(1 + x) = x / (1 + ξ)，其中 0 < ξ < x。由于 1 < 1 + ξ < 1 + x，不等式成立。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Someone coming? Snap the phone shut: the video stops and the decoy fills the screen.": {
