    "iOS lets an app show its own picture on the outer screen while you use the inner one only when the camera is running. Decoy Screen keeps the rear camera on at its lowest setting and throws every frame away. Nothing is recorded or saved, but the camera indicator stays on and it uses some battery.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只有在相机运行时，iOS 才允许应用在你使用内屏的同时往外屏上显示自己的画面。摸鱼浏览器会以最低画质开着后置相机，并丢弃每一帧。不会录制或保存任何内容，但相机指示灯会一直亮着，也会多耗一些电。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
